 record the decoder can’t read is left out and the batch’s other records are read: one whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event it has no type of, one whose type’s version the plan has no schema of, a member that is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"missing or holds what the encoder never writes, and a property the event’s type can’t read","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorDecodingError","type":"reference"},{"text":"). ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchDecoder\/batch(from:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" returns each as an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/UndecodedRecord","type":"reference"},{"text":". A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property a delivery redacted is missing, so its record reads back only when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property is optional or has a default value; a redacted ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" element of an array is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so a record whose array of non-optional ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" elements was redacted is reported as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorDecodingError\/undecodableProperty(event:property:)","type":"reference"},{"text":". An integer outside its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property’s type, such as 300 for a ","type":"text"},{"code":"UInt8","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", is reported the same way. A property of 